    {
      "id": "db5e57fe-9ff1-4ae6-9eee-cf1f44c38434",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Operators",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "db5e57fe-9ff1-4ae6-9eee-cf1f44c38434"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "efb0f8c2-0d86-44d0-b132-b4f089550d",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "int sum = 5 + 3;\nint difference = 5 - 3;\nint product = 5 * 3;\ndouble quotient = 5.0 / 3.0;\nint remainder = 5 % 3;\n\nint increment = 5;\nint decrement = 5;\nincrement++;\ndecrement--;\n\n// following operators have boolean results\nboolean isEqual = 5 == 3;\nboolean isGreater = 5 > 3;\nboolean isLessOrEqual = 5 <= 3;\n\nboolean andCondition = (5 > 3) && (5 < 10);\nboolean orCondition = (5 > 3) || (5 < 10);\nboolean notCondition = !(5 > 3);",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "java",
        "id": "efb0f8c2-0d86-44d0-b132-b4f089550d",
        "executionSummary": {
          "executionOrder": 4,
          "success": true
        }
      },
